# Musikpavillon (bandstand) on the Seepromenade, drawn around the level's
# oneway_wood floor (rows 48..63 here) and the solid roof_shingle roof
# (directly above row 0): four slim wooden posts O/l down to the street,
# a dark scalloped valance under the roof, corner brackets, a criss-cross
# railing O between dark l rails and three small square lanterns.
# D-038: nothing here suggests a surface - no light lips, the railing and
# valance are dark, and under the floor (rows 64..79) there are only the
# posts, so the 2-tile passage reads as open.
# Back-layer prop (layer = "back"): no k, no outlines.
sprite = musikpavillon
size   = 128x80
origin = 64,80
anim   = idle frames=1
---
frame idle 0
